@startuml
title VPC-D03 Normal Live Resolve Sequence
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Channel / terminal" as Channel
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS connector" as Connector
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Channel -> Central : request session lookup
Central -> Central : resolve Site Group and Site
Central -> Central : select VendorSystem + AdapterMapping
Central -> Connector : request live resolve
Connector -> Vendor : query live session facts
Vendor --> Connector : live session result or vendor exception
Connector --> Central : normalized result
Central -> Central : update projection if appropriate
Central -> Audit : record resolve context

note over Central,Connector
Normal resolve does not create payment finality,
fiscal issuance, or ExitAuthorization.
end note
@enduml
